/* 消息行（Figma MessageRow 670:3086）：未读带青瓷小圆点与“未读”；已撤回标题变灰、摘要固定为撤回说明。 */
:host {
  display: block;
}

.message-row {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 8rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 0;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 28rpx 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: transparent;
  text-align: left;
}

.message-row::after {
  border: 0;
}

.message-row--divided {
  border-bottom: 2rpx solid var(--p3-hairline);
}

.message-row__title-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
}

.message-row__dot {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  width: 14rpx;
  height: 14rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--p3-primary);
}

.message-row__title {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
  color: var(--p3-ink);
  font-size: 32rpx;
  line-height: 48rpx;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.message-row--withdrawn .message-row__title {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
}

.message-row__body {
  display: block;
  overflow: hidden;
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 28rpx;
  line-height: 44rpx;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.message-row__meta {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: var(--p3-tight);
  color: var(--p3-muted);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  line-height: 40rpx;
}

.message-row__time {
  flex: 1 0 0;
  min-width: 0;
}

.message-row__status {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.message-row--unread .message-row__status {
  color: var(--p3-primary);
}

.message-row--withdrawn .message-row__status {
  color: var(--p3-muted);
}
